# Brand assets are binary: never diffed, never line-ending-converted (docs/assets/README.md).
*.gif  binary
*.png  binary
*.ico  binary

# Development-only files: in the repository, never in an archive. `git archive` honours this, and
# both the artifact packager (eval/artifact/make_artifact.sh) and GitHub's zip download use it; a
# reviewer or a PyPI user has no use for either file.
CLAUDE.md export-ignore
.github export-ignore
